### Obtener todos los clientes  |Listo 
http://localhost:1234/customer/

###Obtener un cliente por su cedula | listo 
http://localhost:1234/customer/

###Post un nuevo cliente | Listo
POST http://localhost:1234/customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "CI": "27",
    "lastName":"Guzman",
    "name":"Juan",
    "email":"juan@gmail.com"
}

###PATCH actualizar un cliente | listo 
PATCH  http://localhost:1234/customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "CI": "27",
    "lastName":"Guzman",
    "name":"Carlos"
}

### Obtener todos los empleados | listo
http://localhost:1234/employee/

### Obtener un empleado por su cedula | listo 
http://localhost:1234/employee/12345718

### empleados que trabajen en cierto establecimiento  | listo 
http://localhost:1234/employee/RIF/J-11223344-5

### agregar un nuevo empleado |listo
POST http://localhost:1234/employee/ 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "CI": "27",
    "lastName":"Guzmannnnnnn",
    "name":"hola",
    "cellphone":"12345",
    "address":"casa1, calle2",
    "salary":900.00,
    "RIF":"J-00112233-4"
}

###borrar un empledo | listo 
DELETE http://localhost:1234/employee/27

###editar un empleado | listo 
PATCH http://localhost:1234/employee/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "CI": "27",
    "salary":700,
    "address":"los mangos"
}

